<view class="flow-page"><text class="flow-title">补充处方单</text><text class="flow-muted">保存原件，对照现场指导核对动作名称、组数和每组要求。</text><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="flow-error">{{error}}</view><view class="flow-card"><text class="flow-label">选择要补充资料的动作卡</text><picker range="{{cards}}" range-key="name" bindchange="selectCard"><view class="flow-input">{{id ? '已选择动作卡，点击可切换' : '选择动作卡'}}</view></picker><button class="flow-button flow-secondary" bindtap="createCard">新建动作草稿</button><button class="flow-button" disabled="{{busy || !id || images.length >= 10}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="chooseImage">拍摄 / 选择处方单原件</button><text class="flow-small">已保存 {{images.length}} 页，最多 10 页。原件保存在本机，不从图片自动生成训练要求。</text></view><image wx:for="{{images}}" wx:key="*this" src="{{item}}" mode="widthFix" style="width:100%;margin:16rpx 0;border-radius:20rpx" data-path="{{item}}" bindtap="preview" /><button class="flow-button" disabled="{{!id || busy}}" bindtap="finish">回到动作卡逐项核对</button></view>
